WEBVTT

00:00:00.737 --> 00:00:02.638
The agent says it's done.

00:00:02.638 --> 00:00:05.148
Before you merge, check its work.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:08.259
The header shows how many files it changed.

00:00:08.259 --> 00:00:09.881
Nothing is committed yet.

00:00:10.331 --> 00:00:14.418
Open a terminal in the agent's worktree, and look at the diff.

00:00:16.648 --> 00:00:19.620
Then run the tests, right there on the worker.

00:00:21.279 --> 00:00:27.827
They pass. But deleting a note can't be undone, so ask the agent to confirm first.

00:00:31.851 --> 00:00:35.744
Done: revised, tested and committed.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:38.771
The worktree is clean again.

00:00:39.235 --> 00:00:42.903
Now it's ready. Finish merges the branch into main.
